swaydesk (0.1.2-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Development after 0.1.1.
  * swaydesk-desktop depends on a polkit agent (mate-polkit | lxpolkit)
    instead of recommending it. On Ubuntu 26.04, network-manager-applet
    depends on "gnome-shell | policykit-1-gnome | polkit-1-auth-agent", and
    apt 3's solver picked gnome-shell: a minimal install pulled the whole
    GNOME desktop and gdm3.

 -- Nielson Rolim <nielsonrolim@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:17:03 -0300

swaydesk (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The gtk portal is activated directly: after logging out and in again it
    no longer hangs for 120 s, and libadwaita apps keep the dark style. The
    greeter no longer starts the portals.
  * Waybar hides the keyboard layout module when only one layout is set.

 -- Nielson Rolim <nielsonrolim@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:09:08 -0300

swaydesk (0.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild of 0.1.0 with new file names: the OBS rebuilt the 0.1.0-1 Arch
    packages under the same names, and its CDN kept serving the old files
    (pacman: "Maximum file size exceeded"). No code changes.

 -- Nielson Rolim <nielsonrolim@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:36:43 -0300

swaydesk (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release: a desktop session for Sway, with the components in Rust
    and GTK 4 (bar popups, dock, app grid, notifications, screenshot and
    recording, theme, session, help, displays and login screen), shortcut
    profiles, [enabled] and the 50-local.conf for local shortcuts. The
    release notes are in the CHANGELOG.md of the public repository.

 -- Nielson Rolim <nielsonrolim@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0300
